OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 29 MAY
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Miles Davis
OL,5,     F100
OL,6,     GKate Molleson and American jazz
OL,7,     Gcritic Nate Chinen discuss the
OL,8,     Glast chapter in the life and work
OL,9,     Gof Miles Davis.
OL,10,G1700FIn Tune
OL,11,     GKatie Derham welcomes Sir Karl
OL,12,     GJenkins to the studio. She is
OL,13,     Galso joined by pianist Joanna
OL,14,     GKacperek for a live performance.
OL,15,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,16,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,17,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,18,     Gfavourites.
