OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 29 MAY
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GCelebrating Wigmore Hall's 125th
OL,6,     GAnniversary Festival, baritone
OL,7,     GChristian Gerhaher and pianist
OL,8,     GGerold Huber perform works by
OL,9,     GBeethoven, Berg, and Brahms.
OL,10,G2145FThe Essay: Miles Davis 100 -
OL,11,     FMiles Beyond
OL,12,     GJournalist Kevin Legendre
OL,13,     Gexplores how Miles Davis
OL,14,     Gbroadened the jazz repertoire,
OL,15,     Gcovering pop hits in the 1980s.
OL,16,G2200FLate Junction
OL,17,     GVerity Sharp shares a remote
OL,18,     Gcollaboration session between
OL,19,     Gtrumpeter Laura Jurd and poet
OL,20,     GAnthony Joseph, celebrating the
OL,21,     Glegacy of jazz icon Miles Davis
OL,22,     Gon his centenary.
