OL,4,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,5,     GSoweto presents music from a
OL,6,     Gselection of previously
OL,7,     Gunreleased recordings of Miles
OL,8,     GDavis live in concert, ranging
OL,9,     Gfrom the 1960s to 1980s.
OL,10,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,11,     GPasquini's oratorio of 1677
OL,12,     Grecounts the martyrdom of a young
OL,13,     GRoman girl, Saint Agnes, the
OL,14,     Gpatron saint of chastity.
OL,15,     GPerformed at the Radovljica
OL,16,     GFestival in Slovenia.
